#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:5 766487cdc0894e72b252db64e2dd872a
msgid "Dock Mode"
msgstr "Dock 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:7 22e2e8bf69a14fc1afba82a650ffb4fe
msgid ""
"The DOCK mode maneuvers a vehicle towards a stationary docking target "
"automatically. Currently, we support docking with the help of a camera "
"attached to a companion computer. The companion computer estimates the pose "
"of the marker (`ArucoMarker/AprilTag "
"<https://april.eecs.umich.edu/software/apriltag>`__) placed at the docking "
"station and sends `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ mavlink "
"messages to the vehicle which are then processed by the precision landing "
"library (`AC_PrecLand "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_PrecLand>`__)"
" to estimate the position of the docking target."
msgstr ""
"Dock "
"模式可自动将车辆引导至静止的停靠目标。目前，支持借助连接到伴随计算机的相机进行停靠。伴随计算机估算放置在停靠站的标记（`ArucoMarker/AprilTag"
" <https://april.eecs.umich.edu/software/apriltag>`__）的姿态，并向车辆发送 "
"`LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ MAVLink "
"消息，这些消息由精确降落库（`AC_PrecLand "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_PrecLand>`__）处理，以估算停靠目标的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:13 15cccaf4018d4d97a6648784f6fedcf5
msgid ""
"Successful tests have been conducted using the OpenMV camera as a companion "
"computer to perform auto-docking. However, any companion computer equipped "
"with an RGB camera (like OpenMV camera, Raspberry Pi, Jetson Nano etc.) "
"which can estimate pose of marker placed at docking target and generate the"
"  `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ mavlink "
"messages to the vehicle's autopilot can be used."
msgstr ""
"已成功使用 OpenMV 相机作为伴随计算机进行自动停靠测试。然而，任何配备 RGB 相机（如 OpenMV 相机、Raspberry "
"Pi、Jetson Nano 等）并能估算停靠目标处标记姿态、生成 `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ MAVLink "
"消息发送给车辆飞控的伴随计算机均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:18 4e0ebf3abd9e493abe798a8b4767cfc5
msgid "The OpenMV Camera"
msgstr "OpenMV 相机"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:20 e7fa121b21dc4fc896e6dd4b88660f56
msgid ""
"OpenMV camera is a pocket sized camera board which is capable of performing "
"various computer vision tasks. It can transmit the required mavlink messages"
" over its UART interface and hence it can be used as a companion computer to"
" perform auto-docking. The camera can be purchased directly from `openmv.io "
"<https://openmv.io/collections/cams>`__"
msgstr ""
"OpenMV 相机是一款口袋大小的相机板，能够执行各种计算机视觉任务。它可以通过 UART 接口传输所需的 MAVLink "
"消息，因此可用作伴随计算机执行自动停靠。相机可直接从 `openmv.io "
"<https://openmv.io/collections/cams>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:25 56c99802b35c4b98bd2d4703e3b6899e
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:27 d169ce408d1447fb8d3682ba1d8dcd76
msgid ""
"The companion computer needs to be connected a serial port on the autopilot "
"via its UART interface."
msgstr "伴随计算机需要通过其 UART 接口连接到飞控上的串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:33 dd277a3ea90943c4af64aba8141c4603
msgid ""
"Connect the camera’s P4, VIN and GND pins to one of the autopilot’s serial "
"ports as shown above. In the image above the OpenMV cam is connected to a "
"Pixhawk’s Telem2 port. The connection scheme would be similar for the other "
"companion computers too. The user just needs to make a connection between TX"
" pin on the companion computer to RX pin of the telemetry port on the "
"autopilot and power up the companion computer."
msgstr ""
"如上图所示，将相机的 P4、VIN 和 GND 引脚连接到飞控的某个串口。上图中 OpenMV 相机连接到 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 "
"端口。其他伴随计算机的连接方案类似。用户只需将伴随计算机的 TX 引脚连接到飞控数传端口的 RX 引脚，并为伴随计算机供电即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:36 4c8a013e32814f5c8885367aaaa2926d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink) if using "
"Serial2/Telem2, if connected to another serial port use the corresponding "
"SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter"
msgstr ""
"若使用 Serial2/Telem2，将 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 "
"1（MAVLink）；若连接到其他串口，使用相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:37 6efd5327965c4abbb2dbc2b108c13465
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:40 adb816de7aae4476bd91fb3d0f60b2d0
msgid "Generating AprilTag Markers"
msgstr "生成 AprilTag 标记"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:46 f8fe5e93012444b89430080653ad458e
msgid ""
"The OpenMV camera has capability to detect the AprilTags. The OpenMV IDE "
"comes with built-in AprilTag generator. The steps to generate an AprilTag "
"using the same are:"
msgstr ""
"OpenMV 相机具备检测 AprilTag 的能力。OpenMV IDE 内置了 AprilTag 生成器。使用它生成 AprilTag 的步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:48 12ca33e4bda74fe09e7bb216c7f02c7d
msgid ""
"Go to Tools -> Machine Vision -> AprilTag generator -> TAG36H11 Family (587 "
"Tags - Recommended). This will open a small dialog box."
msgstr ""
"进入 Tools -> Machine Vision -> AprilTag generator -> TAG36H11 Family（587 个标签 "
"- 推荐）。这将打开一个小对话框。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:49 5c5c62d244b64c5d9ed3efd8e5de5d96
msgid ""
"Set the range of tags you want to generate. For eg. if you want to generate "
"tag number 1, set Min and Max to 1. You can also generate a range of tags at"
" once by setting the Min and Max values accordingly."
msgstr "设置要生成的标签范围。例如，如果要生成第 1 号标签，将最小值和最大值都设为 1。也可以通过相应设置最小值和最大值一次生成一系列标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:50 d3fd7d3b10ab490bbfa46f69c2e2e4d3
msgid "Click ok and save the tags to the desired directory."
msgstr "点击确定并将标签保存到所需目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:52 a43f4c7fc6034d23a5de9e6b39d050b1
msgid ""
"After successfully generating the tag, the user can print it out and place "
"it vertically at the docking target. The default printing size of tag as per"
" the `example script "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ in following "
"section is 165 mm. A tag of this size is obtained by simply printing the "
"generated tag image on an A4 size sheet."
msgstr ""
"成功生成标签后，用户可打印出来并竖直放置在停靠目标处。根据以下部分 `示例脚本 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ 的默认打印尺寸为 "
"165mm。将生成的标签图像打印在 A4 纸上即可获得此尺寸的标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:58 69a3de18965e4b7989de40d2fb21d3ca
msgid ""
"The maximum range of marker detection while using the `example script "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ mentioned in next"
" section and a 165 mm marker is around 1.5 - 2 m. This range can be "
"increased by using a marker of bigger size. The maximum range of around 4 m "
"has been successfully obtained by using a 380 mm marker during the tests. "
"Instructions about modifying the script for using bigger markers are "
"discussed in next section."
msgstr ""
"使用下节所述 `示例脚本 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ 和 165mm "
"标记时，最大检测范围约为 1.5 到 2 米。使用更大尺寸的标记可以增加此范围。测试中使用 380mm 标记时成功获得了约 4 "
"米的最大范围。下节将讨论修改脚本以使用更大标记的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:63 9dcf8d4994564399a3acbed675a5541f
msgid "Uploading Code to the Camera"
msgstr "向相机上传代码"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:65 9714c4c97cb14d8687acdace5072b875
msgid ""
"The OpenMV camera can be programmed using the OpenMV IDE. Detailed "
"instructions to do so can be found `here "
"<http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV 相机可使用 OpenMV IDE 进行编程。详细操作说明请参阅 `此处 "
"<http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:67 470a1bbb41134457994051c9497264d6
msgid "Connect the OpenMV camera to your PC using  a micro USB cable."
msgstr "使用 micro USB 线将 OpenMV 相机连接到电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:68 909acd493fa848ffa8e2043c6ec73d8e
msgid ""
"Open the OpenMV IDE and click the connect button at the bottom left corner "
"of the IDE window."
msgstr "打开 OpenMV IDE，点击 IDE 窗口左下角的连接按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:69 8f5c7aa0557b4afa8a3d68c16d419c14
msgid ""
"Go to file menu, create new file and copy `this "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ script to the "
"editor window."
msgstr ""
"进入文件菜单，创建新文件，并将 `此 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/master/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py>`__ 脚本复制到编辑器窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:71 998ac6f223bf4cfd93c12c062138f957
msgid ""
"Set the tag number and the size of the marker `here "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/8587f8d7c6d2c23b75e86154c73ae45bc8935bc0/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py#L29>`__. The size "
"must be measured from edge to edge (including the black border) in mm."
msgstr ""
"在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/blob/8587f8d7c6d2c23b75e86154c73ae45bc8935bc0/scripts/examples/07-Interface-"
"Library/02-MAVLink/mavlink_apriltags_landing_target.py#L29>`__ "
"设置标签编号和标记尺寸。尺寸须从边缘到边缘（包括黑色边框）以毫米为单位测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:73 a89fa228a566496c9518cae6b5b89d0a
msgid ""
"To upload the code to the camera go to Tools menu and click on `Save open "
"script to OpenMV Cam (as main.py)`."
msgstr ""
"要将代码上传到相机，进入 Tools 菜单并点击「Save open script to OpenMV Cam (as main.py)」。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:74 0befc807a7bf4f55b2cdb2980291f54b
msgid ""
"Done! Now you can remove the micro USB cable and power up the camera using "
"an external power source. If the script is successfully running, you should "
"see a RED or GREEN LED blinking on the camera. The led flashes GREEN when "
"the marker is in sight of the camera whereas it flashes RED when the camera "
"can't see the marker."
msgstr ""
"完成！现在可以拔掉 micro USB 线，通过外部电源为相机供电。如果脚本成功运行，您应该看到相机上有红色或绿色 LED 闪烁。当标记在相机视野内时 "
"LED 闪绿色，当相机看不到标记时 LED 闪红色。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:78 a3474871678740f9a4379837ec732949
msgid "Mounting to the vehicle"
msgstr "安装到车辆上"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:80 08e2c2632f434e4486eb07793bec1ec4
msgid ""
"The camera should be mounted at the front of the vehicle. The camera board "
"should be mounted such that the camera edge with the lens is upwards (i.e., "
"away from the ground). This is the default setup configuration that we think"
" would be used in most of the cases. However, support for mounting the "
"camera at the back and in different mounting orientations is also provided. "
"If you want to mount the camera in any other configuration, please don't "
"forget to set the related `PLND_XXX` parameters accordingly."
msgstr ""
"相机应安装在车辆前部。相机板的安装方式应使镜头侧朝上（即远离地面）。这是我们认为大多数情况下会使用的默认安装配置。但也支持将相机安装在后部和不同安装方向。如果要以其他配置安装相机，请不要忘记相应设置相关的"
" `PLND_XXX` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:86 6d80b6f924844ef2a3128e274496d536
msgid ""
"The precision landing library also relies on the vehicle's compass to "
"construct the target vector. Any kind of `magnetic interference "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/common-magnetic-interference.html>`__ in "
"the vehicle's compass may lead to the vehicle behaving inappropriately "
"during the docking process."
msgstr ""
"精确降落库还依赖车辆的罗盘来构建目标向量。车辆罗盘中任何形式的 `磁干扰 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/common-magnetic-interference.html>`__ "
"都可能导致停靠过程中车辆行为异常。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:90 33277cc6a41e4884b20074e579640fd0
msgid "Setup through GCS"
msgstr "通过地面站进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:92 bbfb87d1562c493a8acb460e45781df0
msgid ""
"The following parameters are needed to be set to enable the precision "
"landing using a companion computer on the rover."
msgstr "需要设置以下参数，以在 Rover 上使用伴随计算机启用精确降落功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:94 e7871147fbf44310ab17764c83bf2ca1
msgid ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:95 3956e25ccffc401da2810e0587bde0ca
msgid ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:97 7c11b4557ba94befb134249a70fd6476
msgid ""
"You would need to reboot the vehicle once you set up the above mentioned "
"parameters."
msgstr "设置上述参数后需要重启车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:99 94065be394f14d7d93ddb51668d73e59
msgid ""
"If you are mounting the camera in any configuration other than the default "
"configuration mentioned in the previous section, please set the following "
"parameters appropriately."
msgstr "如果以上节所述默认配置以外的其他方式安装相机，请适当设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:101 7d38fa1c9ab54856bec02fb09c186ce0
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>`, :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>`, :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`: Position of "
"camera in body frame (in m)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>`、:ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>`、:ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`：相机在机体坐标系中的位置（单位：米）"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:102 763e7c6a794d4af8b4cdbb6698bdd43b
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>`: Orientation of camera on vehicles body. "
"The camera can be mounted at the front or at the back of the vehicle's body"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>`：相机在车辆机身上的朝向。相机可安装在车辆机身的前部或后部"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:103 8b86676b462e458bacc660dec520dab3
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`: Angle of rotation of camera from "
"default configuration to mounted configuration around the axis pointing out "
"from it's lens (in centi degrees)"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`：相机从默认配置到安装配置绕镜头轴的旋转角度（百分之一度）"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:105 5ba7133882c744968fb8d59ddf771de0
msgid "The docking process can be fine tuned using the following parameters."
msgstr "可使用以下参数对停靠过程进行精细调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:107 b9ed2467c00846618b23f1e7181134c1
msgid ""
":ref:`DOCK_SPEED <DOCK_SPEED>`: The maximum speed limit at the which the "
"vehicle can maneuver in the dock mode."
msgstr ":ref:`DOCK_SPEED <DOCK_SPEED>`：车辆在 Dock 模式下机动的最大速度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:108 dfc58112354b41c7b0afba3c3aeab747
msgid ""
":ref:`DOCK_HDG_CORR_EN <DOCK_HDG_CORR_EN>`: To enable the heading correction"
" while docking. This would enable the vehicle to dock head-on onto the "
"docking station even if the dock mode is switched while the vehicle is not "
"exactly in front of the dock. Note that this feature works only if "
":ref:`DOCK_DIR <DOCK_DIR>` parameter is correctly set."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DOCK_HDG_CORR_EN <DOCK_HDG_CORR_EN>`：启用停靠时的航向校正。这使车辆即使在不在停靠站正前方时切换到 "
"Dock 模式，也能正面停靠到停靠站。注意此功能仅在 :ref:`DOCK_DIR <DOCK_DIR>` 参数正确设置时有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:109 3f923260f3ad4e5f9b71860d2c891e84
msgid ""
":ref:`DOCK_DIR <DOCK_DIR>`: This is the compass direction in which the "
"vehicle is desired to head while docking. This direction is opposite to the "
"direction in which the docking station is facing. For eg., if the docking "
"station is facing North, the vehicle is desired to dock from the south and "
"hence the parameter should be set with the value 180 degrees."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DOCK_DIR "
"<DOCK_DIR>`：停靠时车辆期望朝向的罗盘方向。此方向与停靠站朝向相反。例如，若停靠站朝北，则车辆期望从南侧停靠，因此该参数应设置为 180 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:110 affb0a071b5d434ca7279ec78aa1d9a0
msgid ""
":ref:`DOCK_HDG_CORR_WT <DOCK_HDG_CORR_WT>`: This parameter defines how "
"aggressively the vehicle tries to corrects its heading."
msgstr ":ref:`DOCK_HDG_CORR_WT <DOCK_HDG_CORR_WT>`：此参数定义车辆纠正航向的激进程度。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:111 0d57f634f6ed474486b3098ae1c82b19
msgid ""
":ref:`DOCK_STOP_DIST <DOCK_STOP_DIST>`: The distance from the docking "
"station at which the vehicle should stop (in meter)."
msgstr ":ref:`DOCK_STOP_DIST <DOCK_STOP_DIST>`：车辆距停靠站应停止的距离（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/dock-mode.rst:115 ee04067ea740490ab203753dafc0837e
msgid ""
"Be prepared to retake control if there are sudden unexpected movements "
"(Change mode to Hold or manual)."
msgstr "如出现突然意外移动，请随时准备重新接管控制（切换到 Hold 或 Manual 模式）。"
